  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets.\n• TIP: Cut the cauliflower to the correct size so it cooks in the allocated time.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594ab/step-3a2f0200.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine garlic aioli and a drizzle of olive oil.\n• In a second large bowl, combine panko breadcrumbs, Nan’s special seasoning, garlic & herb seasoning, Parmesan cheese and a good drizzle of olive oil.\n• Toss a handful of cauliflower in the aioli until well coated. Transfer to breadcrumb mixture and toss to coat. Transfer to a lined oven tray, then repeat with remaining cauliflower",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594ab/step-ff678710.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread cauliflower out in a single layer. Bake until golden, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594ab/step-799a1520.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the cauliflower is baking, thinly slice apple into wedges.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594ab/step-19c58830.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Just before serving, in a third large bowl, combine spinach & rocket mix, cucumber, apple and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594ab/step-6c205340.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rocket salad between bowls.\n• Top with Parmesan and herb crumbed cauliflower and any remaining crumbs left on the oven tray.\n• Drizzle over caesar dressing to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/683957f0d9848b9dac0594ab/step-4dadfb50.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
